58
00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:15,400
>> I stopped memorizing dozens of other

59
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:17,440
equations and tangential ideas. I didn't

60
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:20,120
need to know a bunch of forces and

61
00:02:17,440 --> 00:02:23,440
masses and accelerations. I just needed

62
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:25,320
to remember that formula, F equals MA.

63
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:27,440
>> He walked into the exam that day

64
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:29,920
