72
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:47,920
>> Everybody assumed that I had gotten the

73
00:02:45,200 --> 00:02:49,520
47. My classmates were playfully jeering

74
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:51,120
me. And I'm sitting there thinking about

75
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:53,520
like, okay, now that I've failed out of

76
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:55,560
engineering, what will my major be? And

77
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:57,280
when I got my test back, I realized why

