126
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:41,240
He asked people to improve a short

127
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:44,640
essay.

128
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:46,360
Only 17% subtracted words. The other

129
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:47,760
83%?

130
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:49,600
