149
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:33,720
more experiment inspired by a

150
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:35,640
long-running disagreement with his wife,

151
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:38,080
who likes to stuff family travel

152
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:40,080
