153
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:41,520
fictional itinerary for a day in

154
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:44,280
Washington, D.C.

155
00:05:41,520 --> 00:05:46,320
14 hours. The White House, the National

156
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:48,560
Cathedral, the Old Post Office, the

157
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:51,680
Lincoln Memorial, the Vietnam Veterans

