00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:16,560
>> And the rest?

169
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:18,760
>> Well, some rearranged, but most added.

170
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:20,640
>> They added to a schedule that was

171
00:06:18,760 --> 00:06:23,080
already physically impossible to

172
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:26,040
